WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.100
-The GOP and Fox News are lying

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.000
about the state
of the economy under Joe Biden

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.834
and attempting to purge
from their ranks anyone

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:10.334
who dared vote for a bipartisan
infrastructure bill.

00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:12.400
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.634
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:20.100
There is a fundamental asymmetry
between the left and the right,

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.434
which is that one side is,

00:00:21.434 --> 00:00:23.567
for all its many flaws,
at least interested

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:25.701
in attempting
to govern competently.

00:00:25.701 --> 00:00:27.467
The other side, meanwhile,
has been captured

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:30.667
by a cult-like movement filled
with authoritarian weirdos

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:32.968
and cartoon gangsters
who always look like

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:35.067
they've either been chugging
white wine spritzers

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:38.367
[ Laughter ]
after everyone turns on them
at a "Real Housewives" reunion

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.367
or they just got hit
in the balls

00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:43.934
[ Laughter ]
with a swinging paint can
by Kevin McCallister.

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:46.667
Although, in fairness,
Rudy usually looks more like

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:49.400
he's just realized he's been
left home alone by his parents.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:52.467
[ As Giuliani ]
Oh, no. How am I going
to take care of myself?

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:53.834
I'm only 800 years old.

00:00:53.834 --> 00:00:54.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.901 --> 00:00:56.968
For example, there's been
a global climate summit

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:58.968
in Glasgow, where world leaders
have been gathering

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:01.934
to tackle the existential threat
posed by climate change.

00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:04.634
And one of the major speakers
was former President Obama

00:01:04.634 --> 00:01:06.634
and, before he got
to the serious stuff,

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:07.901
he, once again, started out

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.968
with some of his trademark
stand-up comedy material.

00:01:10.968 --> 00:01:13.934
-I am a private citizen now,

00:01:13.934 --> 00:01:19.601
so trips like this feel a little
bit different than they used to.

00:01:19.601 --> 00:01:23.901
I don't get invited
to the big group photo.

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:25.934
Traffic is a thing again.

00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:28.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:30.767
Music doesn't play when I walk
into the room.

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:34.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:37.200
On the positive side,
I can give a speech like this

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.767
without wearing a tie

00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:42.501
and not create a scandal
back home.

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:43.501
[ Laughter ]
-Now that's what you'd think,

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:46.033
but Fox News is going to go
wall-to-wall with coverage

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.901
of your open collar
and a headline like...

00:01:48.734 --> 00:01:51.234
[ Laughter ]
or...

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.934
[ Laughter ]
But, more importantly, man,

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:55.133
this guy always
has new comedy material.

00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:58.033
Now he's doing bits about what
it's like being out of office.

00:01:58.033 --> 00:02:00.234
I don't know
how relatable it is, though.

00:02:00.234 --> 00:02:02.234
[ As Obama ]
You know that thing where,
one day,

00:02:02.234 --> 00:02:03.801
you're the most powerful man
in the world

00:02:03.801 --> 00:02:05.834
and, the next day, your, uh,

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.467
wife is counting your Allman's?

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:09.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.567 --> 00:02:10.801
"No!"

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:11.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.901 --> 00:02:14.267
But, after he was done testing
out new stand-up material,

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.868
Obama talked about the
responsibility of rich nations

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:20.100
and rich people to take the lead
in solving the climate crisis,

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.501
so that the burden of switching
to renewable energy

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:25.868
doesn't fall disproportionately
on the poor and working-class.

00:02:25.868 --> 00:02:27.701
-A country like the U.S.,
with a higher

00:02:27.701 --> 00:02:30.567
per capita carbon footprint
does have to do more

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:33.901
than a country
like Mali or Bangladesh.

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:38.400
It's also why we need
to make sure

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.734
the people most affected by the
transition to clean energy

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:46.901
aren't the ones bearing most
of the cost.

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:49.133
They don't have any margin
for error.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:55.868
I can afford to give up a lot
of my current lifestyle

00:02:55.868 --> 00:02:57.367
to benefit the planet

00:02:57.367 --> 00:02:59.501
because I'll still have
a lot left over.

00:02:59.501 --> 00:03:01.968
A lot of folks
don't have that cushion.

00:03:01.968 --> 00:03:03.767
-He's right on both counts --
most people don't have

00:03:03.767 --> 00:03:05.934
that cushion, but Obama does.
I mean, look at him.

00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:08.200
Remember how he aged
like 20 years in office?

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.601
[ Laughter ]
Well, somehow,
he's aged backwards

00:03:10.601 --> 00:03:12.934
[ Laughter ]
like 20 years,
after he left office.

00:03:12.934 --> 00:03:15.033
It's like when a friend
who was in a miserable marriage

00:03:15.033 --> 00:03:18.100
posts pics of herself on a beach
in Cozumel after her divorce.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.434
"Damn, Janice!

00:03:19.434 --> 00:03:20.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:21.501
You look good!"

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:24.634
Obama looks like a hotshot
investor on "Succession,"

00:03:24.634 --> 00:03:27.234
[ Laughter ]
who's threatening to take
control of the company.

00:03:27.234 --> 00:03:29.567
In next week's episode,
he has to convince Cousin Greg

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:30.634
to come over to his side.

00:03:30.634 --> 00:03:32.434
[ As Greg ]
Um, yeah, I'm, uh,
I'm pretty sure

00:03:32.434 --> 00:03:33.834
that, uh, Logan told me not

00:03:33.834 --> 00:03:35.901
to, uh, consort
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:35.901 --> 00:03:38.667
with any ex-presidents or other
high-ranking luminaries,

00:03:38.667 --> 00:03:41.167
or I could end up,
in his words, uh,

00:03:41.167 --> 00:03:42.434
"pretty well [bleep]."

00:03:42.434 --> 00:03:44.467
[ Laughter and applause ]
Now, again, that's not to say

00:03:44.467 --> 00:03:46.634
Democrats are doing enough
to tackle climate change

00:03:46.634 --> 00:03:48.901
or that Obama couldn't have done
more when he was president.

00:03:48.901 --> 00:03:50.434
He could've done more then

00:03:50.434 --> 00:03:51.834
and Democrats could be
doing more now.

00:03:51.834 --> 00:03:53.501
They still need
to get their massive

00:03:53.501 --> 00:03:55.334
social spending bill
across the finish line

00:03:55.334 --> 00:03:57.834
to invest in clean energy,
among many other things,

00:03:57.834 --> 00:03:59.601
but, in addition to dealing
with obstructionists

00:03:59.601 --> 00:04:01.367
in their own caucus,
who seem hell-bent

00:04:01.367 --> 00:04:03.934
on protecting fossil fuels,
they're also up against a GOP

00:04:03.934 --> 00:04:06.300
and right-wing media apparatus
filled with shameless liars

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.234
who have no interest
in doing anything at all

00:04:08.234 --> 00:04:09.334
about the effects
of climate change.

00:04:09.334 --> 00:04:11.534
For example, here's the
lieutenant governor of Texas,

00:04:11.534 --> 00:04:13.467
explaining,
in the dumbest way possible,

00:04:13.467 --> 00:04:16.367
[ Laughter ]
why he thinks wind
and solar power don't work.

00:04:16.367 --> 00:04:19.834
-You cannot run America

00:04:19.834 --> 00:04:21.267
on green energy.

00:04:21.267 --> 00:04:24.467
We have to have thermal gas.
we have to have coal,

00:04:24.467 --> 00:04:26.834
and we have to have nuclear.

00:04:26.834 --> 00:04:29.434
We saw it in our freeze
last year in Texas.

00:04:29.434 --> 00:04:33.367
We needed more thermal gas,
not more Green New Deal.

00:04:33.367 --> 00:04:36.868
We were an example last year,
quite frankly, in the freeze,

00:04:36.868 --> 00:04:38.901
that, when we needed
to rely on renewables,

00:04:38.901 --> 00:04:40.067
they weren't there.

00:04:40.067 --> 00:04:41.667
What happens if you go all-green

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:43.033
and destroy the oil
and gas industry;

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:46.267
and the coal industry
in Wyoming and West Virginia?

00:04:46.267 --> 00:04:49.133
You can't rely on the wind
to always blow

00:04:49.133 --> 00:04:51.234
or the sun to be out.

00:04:51.234 --> 00:04:53.300
[ Laughter ]
-Well, that's not how it works,
you dingus.

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:56.100
[ Laughter ]
Did these people learn
about renewable energy

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.300
from a Hallmark card?

00:05:03.934 --> 00:05:05.267
[ Laughter ]

00:05:05.267 --> 00:05:07.868
Do these people genuinely not
realize that renewable energy,

00:05:07.868 --> 00:05:10.400
just like any other form
of energy, can be stored?

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.901
Have they never heard
of batteries?

00:05:11.901 --> 00:05:13.634
When your TV remote dies,

00:05:13.634 --> 00:05:15.701
do you just jam
a lump of coal in there?

00:05:15.701 --> 00:05:16.767
[ Laughter ]

00:05:16.767 --> 00:05:18.701
Do they also think
you can't get electricity,

00:05:18.701 --> 00:05:21.334
unless you catch it
with a key attached to a kite?

00:05:21.334 --> 00:05:23.300
[ Laughter ]
"Honey, storm's coming!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.734
I think we'll have
enough lightning

00:05:24.734 --> 00:05:26.434
to watch an episode
of 'House Hunters'!"

00:05:26.434 --> 00:05:28.467
[ Laughter ]
Also, none of what he said

00:05:28.467 --> 00:05:30.033
about the Texas blackouts
is true.

00:05:30.033 --> 00:05:31.901
The vast majority
of the power failure

00:05:31.901 --> 00:05:34.033
during the winter blackout came
from fossil fuels.

00:05:46.801 --> 00:05:48.534
And, of course, it wasn't
the Green New Deal's fault.

00:05:48.534 --> 00:05:50.801
Obviously, most of the failures
came from coal and gas.

00:05:50.801 --> 00:05:53.067
It's Texas.
The TV show "Dallas" was

00:05:53.067 --> 00:05:55.033
about a family who was rich
from oil, not wind.

00:05:55.033 --> 00:05:57.467
[ Laughter ]
When we finally found out
who shot J.R.,

00:05:57.467 --> 00:05:58.868
it was his sister-in-law
Kristin,

00:05:58.868 --> 00:06:00.634
not a windmill with a gun.

00:06:00.634 --> 00:06:01.667
[ Laughter ]

00:06:01.667 --> 00:06:03.400
Moving on.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.701
I'm sorry, Wally,
is there a problem?

00:06:05.701 --> 00:06:07.767
-Uh, could've used
a spoiler alert

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:09.434
before you ruined "Dallas"!

00:06:09.434 --> 00:06:12.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.934 --> 00:06:14.701
-You are still going
to watch "Dallas,"

00:06:14.701 --> 00:06:16.934
a show from 40 years ago?

00:06:16.934 --> 00:06:18.701
-I am watching "Dallas."

00:06:18.701 --> 00:06:22.167
I just finished Season 3
and you just ruined Season 4!

00:06:22.167 --> 00:06:24.701
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, my God! Next, you're going
to tell me you don't know

00:06:24.701 --> 00:06:27.234
Henry Blake's plane
was shot down on "M-A-S-H."

00:06:27.234 --> 00:06:28.534
-It was?!

00:06:28.534 --> 00:06:30.133
[ Laughter ]

00:06:30.133 --> 00:06:31.901
-I am so sorry about this bit,
everybody,

00:06:31.901 --> 00:06:33.167
but the network suggested that,

00:06:33.167 --> 00:06:34.567
since Taylor Swift was
on the show,

00:06:34.567 --> 00:06:37.000
we should reference
the kind of television shows

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.267
that her fans watch,
like "Dallas" and "M-A-S-H."

00:06:39.267 --> 00:06:41.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:41.934 --> 00:06:43.000
You understand.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.067
[ Cheering ]

00:06:46.067 --> 00:06:47.767
They had heard the audience
would be full

00:06:47.767 --> 00:06:49.167
of Loretta Switties.

00:06:49.167 --> 00:06:52.167
[ Laughter ]

00:06:55.367 --> 00:06:57.934
Anyway, the point is,
these people are willingly --

00:06:57.934 --> 00:06:59.968
So --

00:06:59.968 --> 00:07:02.300
Anyway, the point is --
Guys, the point.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:04.834
Can we please leave that
in the past?

00:07:04.834 --> 00:07:06.868
[ Laughter ]

00:07:06.868 --> 00:07:09.067
The point is
these people are willing

00:07:09.067 --> 00:07:11.400
to lie so brazenly
and shamelessly about anything,

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:13.534
and that includes
the current economic situation.

00:07:13.534 --> 00:07:15.767
There's no doubt
there are serious issues,

00:07:15.767 --> 00:07:18.267
between inflation
and the supply chain crisis,

00:07:18.267 --> 00:07:20.400
but, last night,
Fox host Laura Ingraham tried

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.801
to compare the economic
records of Trump and Biden,

00:07:22.801 --> 00:07:24.501
in the most
deceptive way possible.

00:07:24.501 --> 00:07:27.300
See if you can catch what's
misleading about this graphic.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.634
-During Trump's presidency
and before the pandemic,

00:07:29.634 --> 00:07:33.901
164,579,000 Americans
were working,

00:07:33.901 --> 00:07:36.000
but, under Biden, a staggering

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:40.334
3,121,000 fewer
[ Laughing ] Americans are

00:07:40.334 --> 00:07:41.667
in the workforce.
-Huh.

00:07:41.667 --> 00:07:44.067
I can't get remember.
Did anything major happen

00:07:44.067 --> 00:07:46.167
[ Laughter ]
between those two numbers?

00:07:46.167 --> 00:07:47.467
I'm sorry if I'm a little foggy.

00:07:47.467 --> 00:07:49.133
I was trapped in an attic
for a few months,

00:07:49.133 --> 00:07:51.534
[ Laughter ]
wiping down doorknobs with Lysol

00:07:51.534 --> 00:07:53.534
and hoarding the last scraps
of toilet paper

00:07:53.534 --> 00:07:54.934
I could buy
off the black market,

00:07:54.934 --> 00:07:56.601
while slowly descending
into a madness

00:07:56.601 --> 00:07:59.167
so fully encompassing that,
for long stretches of time,

00:07:59.167 --> 00:08:00.801
I could only hear
my own thoughts

00:08:00.801 --> 00:08:03.000
in the voice
of MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.267
[ Laughter ]
[ As Lindell ]
Oh, darn it!

00:08:04.267 --> 00:08:06.934
I forgot to buy milk
at the grocery store.

00:08:06.934 --> 00:08:09.567
I better go back
before my wife realizes

00:08:09.567 --> 00:08:11.834
all I bought was a six-pack of

00:08:11.834 --> 00:08:13.000
da beers.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.968
[ Laughter ]
Now, not only are Republicans

00:08:15.968 --> 00:08:17.634
and Fox News lying
about the economy,

00:08:17.634 --> 00:08:19.534
they're also
so fundamentally opposed

00:08:19.534 --> 00:08:20.701
to addressing those issues,

00:08:20.701 --> 00:08:22.801
or even having
a functioning government,

00:08:22.801 --> 00:08:24.167
that they're now threatening
to purge

00:08:24.167 --> 00:08:25.501
any Republicans from their ranks

00:08:25.501 --> 00:08:27.434
who voted for Biden's
infrastructure bill.

00:08:27.434 --> 00:08:29.167
Marjorie Taylor Greene
called them traitors

00:08:29.167 --> 00:08:31.367
and former Trump
Chief of Staff Mark Meadows said

00:08:31.367 --> 00:08:33.067
they should be stripped
of their committee assignments.

00:08:33.067 --> 00:08:35.234
Trump himself blasted
those Republicans in a speech

00:08:35.234 --> 00:08:37.868
that he later released himself
in highlight reel form.

00:08:37.868 --> 00:08:39.534
-I say it with a heavy heart.

00:08:39.534 --> 00:08:43.334
No, thank you goes to those
in the House and Senate

00:08:43.334 --> 00:08:47.534
who voted for the Democrats
non-infrastructure bill,

00:08:47.534 --> 00:08:51.033
also known as the Democrat
presidential reelection bill.

00:08:51.033 --> 00:08:53.567
It's only 11% was
infrastructure, by the way,

00:08:53.567 --> 00:08:55.167
11% of that bill.

00:08:55.167 --> 00:08:57.567
Much of it's
Green New Deal crap.

00:08:57.567 --> 00:09:00.267
Just like throwing money
out the window.

00:09:00.267 --> 00:09:03.701
But you gave Biden a victory,

00:09:03.701 --> 00:09:06.868
as his poll numbers
were falling off a cliff.

00:09:06.868 --> 00:09:08.701
[ Laughter ]
-Sorry, but you did have
four years

00:09:08.701 --> 00:09:10.067
to pass an infrastructure bill

00:09:10.067 --> 00:09:12.267
and you wasted it whining
about CNN's ratings

00:09:12.267 --> 00:09:14.067
and drawing graffiti
on weather maps.

00:09:14.067 --> 00:09:17.767
[ Laughter ]
That's a joke from our new
segment, "Remember That?"

00:09:17.767 --> 00:09:19.133
♪♪

00:09:19.133 --> 00:09:20.300
[ Laughter ]

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:22.701
When the president defaced
a weather map with a Sharpie

00:09:22.701 --> 00:09:24.400
because he lied
about a hurricane?

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:25.467
[ Laughter ]

00:09:25.467 --> 00:09:27.267
The only way it could've been
more obvious is

00:09:27.267 --> 00:09:29.000
if he tagged it
with his initials.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.968
[ Laughter ]

00:09:30.968 --> 00:09:32.100
This has been "Remember That?"

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:33.601
♪♪
[ Cheering and laughter ]

00:09:33.601 --> 00:09:35.133
[ Applause ]
But that's where we're at now --

00:09:35.133 --> 00:09:37.267
keeping roads and bridges
from falling apart

00:09:37.267 --> 00:09:38.767
is considered
giving Democrats a win,

00:09:38.767 --> 00:09:40.501
instead of doing something
good for the country.

00:09:40.501 --> 00:09:42.634
If Republicans had their way,
the Verrazzano Bridge

00:09:42.634 --> 00:09:44.834
would just be an off-ramp
into the water

00:09:44.834 --> 00:09:46.767
and New Yorkers would have
to get to Brooklyn

00:09:46.767 --> 00:09:48.234
from Staten Island via kayak.

00:09:48.234 --> 00:09:49.434
[ Laughter ]
[ Italian accent ] Oh!

00:09:49.434 --> 00:09:50.434
What's with this freaking thing?

00:09:50.434 --> 00:09:51.934
If it were any smaller,
I'd have to leave my balls

00:09:51.934 --> 00:09:53.300
in the glove compartment.
Oh!

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:56.300
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.267 --> 00:10:02.167
Also, Biden's numbers
were falling off a cliff?

00:10:02.167 --> 00:10:05.167
Biden's numbers are
in the toilet, for sure,

00:10:05.167 --> 00:10:07.767
but the only recent president
with worse numbers was you.

00:10:07.767 --> 00:10:09.701
This is like if you walked
