00:10:12.033 --> 00:10:14.367
That's right, everybody,
we are still doing Jets jokes

00:10:14.367 --> 00:10:15.801
after they failed to win
back-to-back games.

00:10:15.801 --> 00:10:17.167
And thank God.
It's the last

00:10:17.167 --> 00:10:18.734
easy New York punch line
we have,

00:10:18.734 --> 00:10:21.434
now that the Knicks got good,
LaGuardia's been renovated,

00:10:21.434 --> 00:10:23.067
and de Blasio's leaving office.

00:10:23.067 --> 00:10:24.701
Even the
Cigarette Smoking Cockroach

00:10:24.701 --> 00:10:26.133
is using a nicotine patch now.

00:10:26.133 --> 00:10:27.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:28.367
[ Raspy smoker's voice ]
It's not the same,

00:10:28.367 --> 00:10:29.801
but it takes the edge off.

00:10:29.801 --> 00:10:31.100
[ Laughter ]

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.400
The major divide
in our politics right now is

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.400
that one movement,
for its many flaws,

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.868
is actively interested
in doing things,

00:10:36.868 --> 00:10:38.300
while the other is trying
to purge anyone

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:40.234
who participates in making
our government function,

00:10:40.234 --> 00:10:42.267
and they lie shamelessly
about everything.

00:10:42.267 --> 00:10:43.968
Whenever they open their mouths,
you can expect...

00:10:43.968 --> 00:10:45.434
-The wind to always blow.

00:10:45.434 --> 00:10:47.501
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:47.501 --> 00:10:51.467
♪♪

00:10:51.467 --> 00:10:53.133
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:10:53.133 --> 00:10:54.334
over two million meals a year

00:10:54.334 --> 00:10:56.567
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:10:56.567 --> 00:10:58.133
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:10:58.133 --> 00:10:59.534
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:10:59.534 --> 00:11:01.801
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:11:01.801 --> 00:11:04.634
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

